{"key": "g04", "title": "Particles of the Qur'an 4: Particles That Change Nothing", "subtitle": "Joining, warning, answering, urging and asking", "trigger_at": "2026-11-24T13:00:00.000Z", "body": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "captionedImage", "content": [{"type": "image2", "__img": "cover-g04.png", "alt": "Particles of the Qur'an 4: Particles That Change Nothing"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Particles of the Qur'an, part 4 of 5", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The particles in this part are \"inactive\" ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "ghayr 'aamilah", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", غَيْرُ عَامِلَة, \"not working\"): they add meaning but do not change the ending of the word after them."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Joining words: the conjunctions"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The particles of joining ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "huroof al-'atf", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", حُرُوفُ الْعَطْفِ): وَ \"and\", فَ \"and so\", ثُمَّ \"then, after that\", حَتَّى \"even\", أَوْ \"or\", إِمَّا \"either … or\", أَمْ \"or (in a question)\", لَا \"not\", بَلْ \"rather, no\", لَٰكِنْ \"but\". A word joined by one of these copies the case of the word it is joined to (the conjunction itself changes nothing). Each will get its own post later."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Getting attention"}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Here you are:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " هَا. هَا أَنتُمْ هَٰؤُلَاءِ حَاجَجْتُمْ \"Here you are, those who argued\" (3:66)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Beware, truly:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَلَا. أَلَا سَاءَ مَا يَزِرُونَ \"Beware! Evil is what they carry\" (6:31)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Not to be confused with:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَمَّا \"as for\", which brings out details and is followed by فَ: فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَازِينُهُ \"then as for the one whose scales are heavy\" (101:6)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Saying \"yes\""}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Yes, by…:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " إِي, always with an oath. قُلْ إِي وَرَبِّي إِنَّهُ لَحَقٌّ \"Say: yes, by my Lord, it is the truth\" (10:53)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Yes indeed (after a negative question):", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " بَلَىٰ. أَوَلَيْسَ الَّذِي خَلَقَ السَّمَاوَاتِ وَالْأَرْضَ بِقَادِرٍ … بَلَىٰ \"Is not He who created the heavens and the earth able…? Yes indeed!\" (36:81)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Yes:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " نَعَمْ. قَالَ نَعَمْ وَإِنَّكُمْ لَمِنَ الْمُقَرَّبِينَ \"He said: Yes, and you will be among those brought near\" (7:114)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Explaining"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The particles of explanation are أَيْ \"that is\" and أَنْ \"that is, namely\"."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Urging: \"why not?\""}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The most common is لَوْلَا \"why not\", and a verb follows it. فَلَوْلَا إِذَا بَلَغَتِ الْحُلْقُومَ \"Then why not, when the soul reaches the throat…\" (56:83)."}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Certainty: قَدْ"}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "The particle قَدْ ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "qad", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ") has two uses before a past verb:"}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Certainly:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " it makes the statement sure ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "harf tahqeeq", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", حَرْف تَحْقِيق). قَدْ أَفْلَحَ الْمُؤْمِنُونَ \"Certainly the believers have succeeded\" (23:1)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Just now:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " it brings the past close ("}, {"type": "text", "text": "maadee qareeb", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", مَاضِي قَرِيب, \"near past\"). قَدْ قَامَتِ الصَّلَاةُ \"the prayer has (just) begun\" (from the iqamah)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"textAlign": null, "level": 3}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Asking questions"}]}, {"type": "bullet_list", "content": [{"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "What:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " مَا. وَمَا أَدْرَاكَ مَا هِيَهْ \"And what will make you know what it is?\" (101:10)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Do…? (the hamza):", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " أَ. أَأَمِنتُم مَّن فِي السَّمَاءِ \"Do you feel safe from the One in the heaven?\" (67:16)."}]}]}, {"type": "list_item", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Has…? Did…?:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " هَلْ. وَهَلْ أَتَاكَ حَدِيثُ مُوسَىٰ \"And has the story of Moses reached you?\" (20:9)."}]}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Next:", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " كَلَّا, the two kinds of ت, tanween, and the ن of emphasis."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "From my book", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " Quran Grammar Summary "}, {"type": "text", "text": "(second edition), section 1.5.", "marks": [{"type": "em"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"textAlign": null}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Download this post as a PDF", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ", with all the Arabic in Qur'anic script: "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Particles of the Qur'an 4: Particles That Change Nothing (PDF)", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://www.seemabooks.com/downloads/substack-posts/g04-particles-that-change-nothing.pdf", "target": "_blank", "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow", "class": null}}]}]}]}}